# Protected branches

`Nidavellir` and `uat` stay protected git branches — do not push either directly, and do not force-push them.

Live Render **production** (`nidavellir-api`) currently deploys from **`todo`** (see `render.yaml`). UAT still deploys from **`uat`**. Pushing `todo` updates production API only; it does not update UAT.

```bash
# ❌ git push origin uat
# ❌ git push origin Nidavellir
# ✅ git push -u origin todo   # production Render when dashboard branch is todo
# ✅ gh pr create --base uat   # UAT only
```
